    "section_double_nWjKUV": {
      "type": "section-double",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_bm6Pwr": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Organic Plant-Dyes",
            "text_size": 8,
            "padding_bottom": 8
          }
        },
        "text_NBxkLg": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>To preserve the beauty and integrity of your Heavenly pieces, we recommend gentle care that honors the natural, plant-based dyes and herbal infusions. Since our colors are derived from botanically sourced ingredients— plants, flowers, fruits, vegetables, and minerals, we recommend washing your items in cold water with natural, eco-friendly detergent, and avoid harsh chemicals/ bleach. </p><p>Wash with like colors. Plant-dyes fade naturally over time when washed, and batches may vary in pigment and shade. Line drying out of direct sunlight is best to maintain vibrancy and protect the herbal infusions that support wellness with wear. </p><p>Our plant dyes are GOTS and NODS certified— organic, biodegradable, non-toxic, and environmentally safe. </p>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        }
      },
