          }
        },
        "text_dBbTAX": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Ethereal and elegant, linen lace is a primary feature of our lingerie collections. We use French Leavers lace, made from 100% organic linen fibers.</p><p>Due to the fine nature of lace, it must be treated with great care to avoid damage when washing. Ideally, it should be washed by hand. If using a washing machine, be sure to use a delicate cycle at a low temperature, and use a wash bag.</p>",
