          }
        },
        "text_EkjDVb": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>(Exodus 28:15-21)</strong></p><p>Inspired by the Priests breastplate for holy garments in the Bible. Avoid machine washing or tumble drying, as these methods can damage the metal accessories, crystal accents, and the integrity of the natural materials. To preserve the beauty and integrity of your Heavenly undergarments, which feature real copper, pearl and biblical gemstone details, we recommend gentle, mindful care. </p><p>Gently hand wash, reshape and lay flat to dry. Always hand wash your bras using cool water and a natural detergent free of harsh chemicals, bleach, or synthetic fragrances. Avoid soaking for extended periods, and do not wring or twist the fabric, as this can stress the natural fibers and delicate embellishments.</p><p>Copper is a living metal that will naturally patina over time, adding unique character to your garment. To maintain its warm glow, gently buff the copper details with a soft, dry cloth after wear to remove oils or moisture. Avoid storing your bra in damp environments that may cause discoloration or degrade the organic elements. </p><p>Because our designs are completely plastic-free and made from natural fibers and organic materials, proper care not only extends the life of your lingerie, but also supports our shared commitment to sustainability and conscious luxury.</p>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        }
      },
